等，占总股本比例都在0.3%以下，基本可以忽略不计。\n\n![](https://sf3-ttcdn-tos.pstatp.com/img/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/656a1d4d07554e4ab248c0441d2562e3~cs.jpeg)\n这里有个细节值得留意:表格里每一只解禁股对应的“股东减持情况”都写着“无”。也就是说，根据现有披露，这些解禁股东并没有同步抛出减持计划。当然，这不代表他们永远不会卖，但至少短期内，主动抛售的压力没有想象中那么大。\n不过呢!解禁也不能完全等同于利空。有些票解禁比例高、股东分散，可能会有一定抛压;但如果是大股东长期持股、或者公司基本面扎实，解禁往往只是纸面上的事。真正需要警惕的是那些解禁比例大、同时股东此前有过减持记录或业绩不稳定的公司。从明天这批名单来看，整体压力可控，最需要留意的可能是长源电力和雅葆轩这两只，前者绝对市值大，后者占比高。\n\n![](https://sf3-ttcdn-tos.pstatp.com/img/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/577751ff30674d2ba089bc94a2f150e1~cs.jpeg)\n最后说一句，以上数据来源于东方财富如果和交易所最终披露有出入，以官方为准。解禁只是市场的一个小变量，投资决策还是得看企业长期的经营能力和行业位置。\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：2026年6月A股解禁日历\n\n网页标题：Shanghai and Shenzhen A-Share Indices Rise 0.4% to 2.7% for the Day; YANGTZE OPTICAL FIBRE (601869.SH) Hits Limit Up\n\n网页链接：https://wdatacn.aastocks.com/en/cnhk/news/china-hot-topic-content.aspx?catg=4\u0026id=NOW.1527160\u0026source=AAFN\n\n发布时间：2026-06-02T15:09:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：Shanghai and Shenzhen A-Share Indices Rise 0.4% to 2.7% for the Day; YANGTZE OPTICAL FIBRE (601869.SH) Hits Limit Up\naacat by AASTOCKS\n![](https://plib.aastocks.com/aafnnews/image/medialib/20180425162655575_l.png)\n2026/06/02 15:09 CST\nUnitree Technology's IPO was approved in just 73 days. The RMB central parity against the USD was set at 6.8187, down 20 bps MoM. The PBOC conducted RMB200 million of seven-day reverse repos in the open market today (2nd), with the operation rate unchanged at 1.4%; meanwhile, RMB249 billion of reverse repos matured, resulting in a single-day net withdrawal of RMB248.8 billion. The three major A-share indices opened 0.1% to 0.9% higher and moved divergently before all turning positive in the afternoon, closing up 0.4% to 2.7% for the day.\nThe Shanghai Composite Index rose 17 points, or 0.43%, to close at 4,075, with turnover of RMB1.28 trillion. The Shenzhen Component Index gained 250 points, or 1.63%, to close at 15,591, with turnover of RMB1.51 trillion. The ChiNext Index surged 104 points, or 2.66%, to close at 4,055, with turnover o